# Applications inbox: no crawling, no directory listing.
#
# The password itself is NOT set here. Use cPanel > Directory Privacy on this
# folder -- cPanel writes the AuthUserFile line and the .htpasswd for you, with
# the hash stored outside the web root. Hand-writing credentials into a file
# that sits in public_html is how they end up in a git diff.
#
# index.php refuses to render at all unless Apache has already authenticated
# the request, so a missing or broken password rule fails closed.

Options -Indexes

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow"
</IfModule>
